  "The catalog follows Minecraft 1.21.10 blockstate assets, excluding item frames (entities) and the three empty air types. It includes non-cubes, crossed plant planes, complete tall plants, multipart models and static previews for special block renderers.": "目录依据 Minecraft 1.21.10 的方块状态资源，排除物品展示框实体和三种空气。包括非立方体、交叉植物面片、完整高植物、多部件模型及特殊方块渲染器的静态预览。",
  "visible previews. Barrier, light and structure void have no visible surface. Moving piston is a transient carrier with no fixed material. They stay in the library without invented colours.": "个可见预览。屏障、光源和结构空位没有可见表面；移动的活塞没有固定材质。它们仍保留在目录中，不虚构颜色。",
  "Asset families use actual model-parent paths or the renderer texture directory. Group materials merges identical resolved texture sets and tints, preferring a full cube when available. Cake and its candle decorations share the plain cake representative. Dyed wool, terracotta and other differently coloured base materials remain separate. Turn grouping off to see every variant. Similar colours alone never cause a merge.": "资源分类使用实际模型父路径或渲染器纹理目录。材质分组合并相同纹理集合与染色设置，优先使用完整方块。蛋糕及其蜡烛装饰使用普通蛋糕代表；染色羊毛、陶瓦等主体颜色不同的材质保持独立。关闭分组可显示全部变体，不会仅因颜色接近而合并。",
  "Material variance is the Oklab population covariance of original unlit face texels, weighted by face area and alpha. Invisible pixels contribute nothing; declared internal faces also count. The colour strip shows five weighted colour clusters. This uses the whole representative model, including both halves of a rose bush, independently of the face-colour selector. Variance axes are linear: full scale 0.02 for a, 0.12 for L and 0.02 for b; larger values are not clipped.": "材质方差是原始、未受光照影响的纹理像素在 Oklab 中的总体协方差，按面面积和透明度加权。不可见像素不参与；模型声明的内部面仍参与。颜色条显示五个加权颜色簇。统计覆盖整个模型，包括高植物的上下半部，不受颜色来源选项影响。方差坐标满幅对应 a 为 0.02、L 为 0.12、b 为 0.02，较大值不截断。",
  "One representative placed state is shown. Special renderers use closed/rest poses, default player skins and plain banners/pots. Fluid and portal previews are static. World lighting, neighbour simulation, custom block-entity data and animations are not reproduced.": "每种方块展示一个代表放置状态。特殊渲染器使用闭合／静止姿态、默认皮肤和普通旗帜／陶罐。流体与传送门使用静态预览，不模拟世界光照、邻接状态和自定义方块实体数据。",
  "The optional sRGB wireframe is a sampled display boundary. A convex envelope does not imply continuous available materials.": "可选的 sRGB 线框表示采样色域边界。凸包包络不表示内部所有颜色都存在对应材质。",
  "Layout references ShapeOfColour. All glass controls use the supplied FORM Glass 0.1.0 package. ": "布局参考 ShapeOfColour。玻璃控件使用提供的 FORM Glass 0.1.0 组件包。",
  "1 · Full 1×1×1 cubes": "1 · 完整 1×1×1 立方体",
  "2 · Zero-thickness planes": "2 · 无厚度面片",
  "3 · Entity-rendered / oversized": "3 · 实体渲染／超出一格",
  "4 · Other models": "4 · 其他模型",
  "Surface texels (supplemental)": "表面纹理像素（补充数据）",
  "MineAgent palette": "MineAgent 色板",
  "No intrinsic visible surface": "无固有可见表面",
  "Inactive conduit shell; active effects depend on world state.": "未激活的潮涌核心外壳；激活效果取决于世界状态。",
  "Transient carrier; its appearance depends on the moved block.": "临时载体；外观取决于被移动的方块。",
  "Default Steve skin only; custom player profiles are not fetched.": "仅使用默认史蒂夫皮肤，不获取自定义玩家皮肤。",
  "Static portal texture preview; the animated portal shader is not reproduced.": "静态传送门纹理预览，未复现动态传送门着色器。",
  "Invisible block; no visible colour surface.": "不可见方块，无可见颜色表面。",
  "Static vanilla rest pose; no animation or custom block-entity data.": "原版静止姿态，不包含动画或自定义方块实体数据。",
  "Static first-frame fluid surface preview.": "流体表面首帧静态预览。",
  "Representative blockstate; deterministic north/south connections for multipart models.": "代表性方块状态；多部件模型使用固定南北连接。",
  "Assets grouped by source paths; model filters use four geometry classes.": "详情保留资源路径；模型筛选采用四类几何结构。",
  "Existing MineAgent palette values are preserved. Missing colours are supplemented by alpha- and area-weighted face texels, clearly labelled in the inspector. Nine views include Oklab, sRGB, linear RGB, HSV, HSL cylinder/bicone, XYZ D65, CIELAB D65 and material variance. Original numerical colour values are preserved. Native dimensions are preserved: beds and banners extend across multiple blocks. The spaced lattice leaves at least one full block of clearance, with empty layers for routed movement. Dense areas expand away from their exact colour coordinates.": "保留原有 MineAgent 调色板数值，缺失颜色按原生纹理的面积与透明度加权补充。提供九种色彩空间。模型保留原版尺寸：床和旗帜可占多格。间隔模式至少留出一整格，并预留移动路径；密集区域的位置会为避让而偏离精确颜色坐标。",
  "Packed mode reserves the native model footprint. Dense mode tiles full-size models on the integer lattice, then clips geometry and UVs at material-cell and section boundaries. Dense fill uses the same model size as spaced mode, reserves one cell per displayed material, then assigns remaining in-gamut cells to their nearest material. Reserved material cells may extend beyond the theoretical gamut after collision resolution. Grouping operates on representatives; disable it to reserve every visible filtered block type. Repeated instances share selection. Sections retain whole cells; hue and radius sections are available in cylindrical spaces.": "无间隙模式为完整模型保留实际占地。密铺模式按原尺寸周期铺排，再沿材质单元和切片边界裁切几何与纹理坐标。与间隔模式使用相同方块尺寸，并先为每种显示材质保留一格，再以最近材质填充剩余有效色域单元。保留格可能因避让而超出理论色域。关闭材质分组可显示全部筛选方块；同类实例共享选择。圆柱色彩空间支持色相与半径切片。",
  "One representative placed state is shown. Special renderers use closed/rest poses, default player skins and plain banners/pots. Texture animations follow vanilla frame sequences, durations and interpolation. Translucent blocks retain their texture alpha; end portals use animated layered stars. World lighting, particles, moving block entities and custom data are not reproduced.": "每种方块显示一个代表状态。特殊渲染器使用闭合或静止姿态、默认皮肤及无图案的旗帜和陶罐。纹理动画遵循原版帧序列、时长与插值；半透明方块保留纹理透明度，末地传送门使用动态分层星空。暂不模拟世界光照、粒子、方块实体运动和自定义数据。",
  "Vanilla animated fluid texture; representative fixed fluid level.": "使用原版流体纹理动画，液面高度为固定代表状态。",
  "Animated layered end-portal preview; world fog and particles are omitted.": "动态分层末地传送门预览，不包含世界雾效和粒子。",
