  "Moving blocks together…": "方块正在同步移动…",
  "Colour-space, filter and arrangement changes share one simultaneous Manhattan animation lasting at most one second. Longer routes travel faster. Removed blocks leave through the display envelope; new materials enter from it. Dense copies split from existing instances. Rapid changes keep only the latest queued target; reduced-motion preferences disable movement and start the turntable paused.": "色彩空间、筛选和排列方式共用最长一秒的同步曼哈顿移动动画，距离越远速度越快。移除的方块从显示包络退出，新材质从包络进入，密铺副本从已有实例分裂。快速切换仅保留最新的后续目标；减少动态效果偏好会禁用位移动画，并默认暂停模型转台。",
