  "Material variance uses original unlit face texels weighted by face area and alpha, independently of the face-colour selector. Each axis shows the population variance of the current space's channel. HSV/HSL use linear hue-variance axes instead of rings: hue variance is the minimum mean squared shortest-arc distance, measured in turns squared; achromatic texels do not contribute to hue. HSL bicone uses chroma variance. Fixed axis scales preserve comparisons across filters; numerical variances are shown in the inspector. The five colour clusters are only a summary, not the input to these statistics.": "材质方差按面面积和透明度加权统计原始、未打光的纹理像素，不受表面颜色选择影响。每个坐标轴表示当前色彩空间对应通道的总体方差。HSV/HSL 改用线性色相方差轴：取最短圆弧距离平方的加权均值最小值，单位为圈²，无色像素不参与色相统计。HSL 双锥使用色度方差。坐标轴采用固定比例，便于比较不同筛选结果；具体数值显示在检查器中。五种代表颜色仅用于概览，不参与方差计算。",
  "Existing MineAgent palette values are preserved. Missing colours are supplemented by alpha- and area-weighted face texels, clearly labelled in the inspector. Eight colour spaces include Oklab, sRGB, linear RGB, HSV, HSL cylinder/bicone, XYZ D65 and CIELAB D65. Material variance is an independent mode for every space. Original numerical colour values are preserved. Native dimensions are preserved: beds and banners extend across multiple blocks. The spaced lattice leaves at least one full block of clearance, with empty layers for routed movement. Dense areas expand away from their exact colour coordinates.": "保留 MineAgent 原有调色板数据；缺失颜色使用按面积与透明度加权的表面像素补充。支持 Oklab、sRGB、线性 RGB、HSV、HSL 圆柱／双锥、XYZ D65 和 CIELAB D65 八种空间，每一种均可独立开启材质方差模式。原始数值与模型尺寸均保持不变；床、旗帜等模型可以超过一格。间隔模式保留至少一格空隙，密铺在颜色坐标附近展开。",
  "Colour-space, filter and arrangement changes share one simultaneous Manhattan animation lasting at most one second. Longer routes travel faster. Removed blocks leave through the display envelope; new materials enter from it. Dense transitions move one representative per material to its nearest destination, then fade the static fill and replacement; repeated cells do not animate individually. Rapid changes keep only the latest queued target; reduced-motion preferences disable movement and start the turntable paused.": "色彩空间、筛选和排列方式共用最多一秒的同步曼哈顿移动动画，较远的路径移动更快。移除的材质移出包络边界，新材质从边界进入。密铺仅移动每种材质的一个代表至最合适的位置，其余静态填充和替换采用淡入淡出；重复格子不再逐个移动。连续操作只保留最后一个目标，减少动态效果设置会跳过移动。",
  "Name, ID or 5:1…": "名称、ID 或 5:1…",
  "Air": "空气",
  "No block selected": "未选中方块",
  "FILTERS": "筛选",
  "Minecraft version": "Minecraft 版本",
  "Loading release materials…": "正在加载对应版本材质…",
  "Loading Minecraft release materials…": "正在加载 Minecraft 版本材质…",
  "Release surface texels": "当前版本表面像素",
  "Interactive 3D block colour atlas. Drag to orbit, scroll to zoom. Click a block to select it.": "交互式三维方块色域。拖动旋转，滚轮缩放，点击方块选择。",
  "visible previews. Barrier, light and structure void have no visible surface. Moving piston is a transient carrier with no fixed material. They remain in the catalog without invented colours.": "个可见预览。屏障、光源和结构空位没有可见表面；移动的活塞没有固定材质。它们仍保留在目录中，不虚构颜色。",
  "The catalog follows the selected Minecraft release's block assets, excluding item frames (entities) and the three empty air types. It includes non-cubes, crossed plant planes, complete tall plants, multipart models and static previews for special block renderers.": "目录使用所选 Minecraft 正式版本的方块资源，排除物品展示框（实体）和三种空气。支持非立方体、交叉植物平面、完整高植物、多部件模型和特殊方块渲染器的静态预览。",
  "Colours and variances use the selected release’s original textures, weighted by face area and transparency. Eight colour spaces include Oklab, sRGB, linear RGB, HSV, HSL cylinder/bicone, XYZ D65 and CIELAB D65. Material variance is an independent mode for every space. Original numerical colour values are preserved. Native dimensions are preserved: beds and banners extend across multiple blocks. The spaced lattice leaves at least one full block of clearance, with empty layers for routed movement. Dense areas expand away from their exact colour coordinates.": "颜色和方差使用所选版本的原始纹理，按面面积和透明度加权。提供 Oklab、sRGB、线性 RGB、HSV、HSL 圆柱与双锥、XYZ D65 和 CIELAB D65 八种色彩空间，每种均支持材质方差模式。保留原始数值与模型尺寸：床和旗帜可跨越多个方块。间隔排列至少保留一格空隙，并为路径移动保留空层。密集区域会从准确颜色坐标向外展开。",
  "Material variance uses original unlit face texels weighted by face area and alpha, independently of the face-colour selector. Each axis shows the population variance of the current space's channel. HSV/HSL use linear hue-variance axes instead of rings: hue variance is the minimum mean squared shortest-arc distance, measured in turns squared; achromatic texels do not contribute to hue. HSL bicone uses chroma variance. Fixed logarithmic axis scales preserve comparisons across filters and releases; zero has a finite floor and numerical variances are shown unscaled in the inspector. The five colour clusters are only a summary, not the input to these statistics.": "材质方差按面面积和透明度加权统计原始、未打光的纹理像素，不受表面颜色选择影响。每个轴表示当前色彩空间对应通道的总体方差。HSV/HSL 使用色相方差轴，取最短圆弧距离平方的加权均值最小值，单位为圈²；无色像素不参与色相统计。HSL 双锥使用色度方差。固定对数比例便于跨筛选、跨版本比较；零值具有有限下限，检查器显示未经对数变换的方差数值。五种代表颜色仅用于概览，不参与方差计算。",
